WEBVTT

00:00:00.298 --> 00:00:02.383
Where's Hermione?

00:00:02.592 --> 00:00:05.720
Parvati said she wouldn't
come out of the bathroom.

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:09.974
She said that she'd been in there
all afternoon, crying.

00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:18.107
Troll in the dungeon!

00:00:18.358 --> 00:00:21.653
Troll in the dungeon!

00:00:24.489 --> 00:00:26.824
Thought you ought to know.

00:00:33.665 --> 00:00:36.501
Silence!

00:00:38.127 --> 00:00:42.173
Everyone will please not panic!

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:49.180
Prefects will lead their house
back to the dormitories.

00:00:49.889 --> 00:00:54.686
Teachers will follow me
to the dungeons.

00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:08.908
Gryffindors, keep up, please,
and stay alert.

00:01:09.117 --> 00:01:10.868
Harry: How could a troll get in?

00:01:11.035 --> 00:01:16.207
Not on its own. Trolls are really stupid.
Probably people playing jokes.

00:01:16.457 --> 00:01:20.461
- What?
- Hermione! She doesn't know.

00:01:32.557 --> 00:01:35.810
I think the troll's left the dungeon.

00:01:39.689 --> 00:01:41.858
Harry:
It's going into the girls' bathroom.

00:02:12.889 --> 00:02:15.266
Hermione, move!

00:02:18.603 --> 00:02:22.774
Hermione: Help! Help!

00:02:24.776 --> 00:02:26.861
Hey, pea brain!

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:41.125
Help!

00:03:02.313 --> 00:03:04.649
Do something!

00:03:06.109 --> 00:03:10.071
- What?
- Anything!

00:03:10.655 --> 00:03:13.116
- Hurry up!
- Swish and flick.

00:03:13.324 --> 00:03:15.660
Wingardium leviosa.

00:03:52.989 --> 00:03:55.825
Is it dead?

00:03:56.033 --> 00:03:59.954
I don't think so. Just knocked out.

00:04:05.334 --> 00:04:08.546
Ugh. Troll boogers.

00:04:11.048 --> 00:04:14.594
Oh, my goodness!
Explain yourselves, both of you!

00:04:14.802 --> 00:04:19.390
- Well, what it is...
- It's my fault, professor McGonagall.

00:04:21.601 --> 00:04:22.810
Miss Granger?

00:04:23.686 --> 00:04:28.733
I went looking for the troll.
I thought I could handle it.

00:04:28.983 --> 00:04:30.860
But I was wrong.

00:04:31.068 --> 00:04:36.115
If Harry and Ron hadn't come
and found me, I'd probably be dead.

00:04:37.116 --> 00:04:41.537
McGonagall: Be that as it may,
it was an extremely foolish thing to do.

00:04:41.746 --> 00:04:47.418
I expected more rational behavior
and am very disappointed in you.

00:04:47.627 --> 00:04:50.630
Five points will be taken
from Gryffindor...

00:04:50.838 --> 00:04:54.425
For your serious lack of judgement.

00:04:54.884 --> 00:04:56.886
As for you two gentlemen...

00:04:57.094 --> 00:05:00.515
I just hope you realize
how fortunate you are.

00:05:00.723 --> 00:05:04.143
Not many first-year students
could take on a troll...

00:05:04.352 --> 00:05:06.938
And live to tell the tale.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:09.649
Five points...

00:05:11.025 --> 00:05:14.153
Will be awarded to each of you...

00:05:15.738 --> 00:05:18.783
For sheer dumb luck.

00:05:24.413 --> 00:05:28.167
Perhaps you ought to go.
It might wake up.

00:05:36.467 --> 00:05:38.719
Ron:
Take a bit of toast, mate. Go on.

00:05:38.928 --> 00:05:42.139
Ron's right.
You'll need your strength today.

00:05:42.306 --> 00:05:44.559
I'm not hungry.

00:05:45.142 --> 00:05:50.773
Good luck today, Potter.
You've proven yourself against a troll.

00:05:50.982 --> 00:05:54.151
A game of Quidditch
should be easy work.

00:05:54.318 --> 00:05:57.488
Even if it is against Slytherin.

00:06:05.162 --> 00:06:08.583
- That explains the blood.
- Blood?

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:13.129
Last night, I'm guessing Snape let
the troll in as a diversion...
